@startuml uc_03_set_up_wifi
!theme cyborg
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName SansSerif
skinparam backgroundColor #0b1018
skinparam defaultFontColor #e6edf7
skinparam ArrowColor #a9b8ca
skinparam activity {
 FontColor #0b1018
 DiamondFontColor #e6edf7
}
title F3 Set up Wi-Fi (REQ-11, REQ-12)
start
if (Boot with saved network?) then (yes)
 :Device joins the saved network;
 if (Address assigned?) then (yes)
  :Keep station connected;
 else (no)
  :Show error;
 endif
 :Wait for 2 s hold in Idle;
endif
:Device scans for networks, then opens the hotspot with the setup page;
:Phone joins the open hotspot; QR opens the setup page;
repeat
:Operator selects the network and enters the password of a protected network;
:Device joins the selected network; the page shows the progress;
if (Selected network address assigned?) then (no)
 :Page shows the join error; device scans again with the hotspot open;
endif
repeat while (Join failed?) is (yes) not (no)
 :Device stores the credentials; a failed save is retried once;
 if (Saved?) then (yes)
  :Show success;
 else (no)
  :Show save error; remain connected;
 endif
 :Page shows the result; device closes the hotspot and the setup page;\nKeep station connected;
stop
floating note
 On cancel or timeout the page shows a notice and the device closes the hotspot;
 an established station connection stays.
 Start takes priority: stop setup safely before audio.
 Wi-Fi-only errors preserve audio.
end note
@enduml
